From 23222fc6307f67fc7d1a8641f8ad783cedb7e817 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:27:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] android: Add PID namespace UID CPU accounting

Provide the Android uid_cputime proc paths, microsecond format and file
permissions. Account live and exited threads in each proc PID namespace
and its ancestors, map UIDs through the reader user namespace, and keep
clear operations within that PID namespace. Coordinate exit and readers
without a scheduler-wide UID lock. Free state with its PID namespace.

CONFIG_ANDROID_UID_CPUTIME is optional and the event capability query
reports whether it was compiled in.

Kernel base: e8694cdbd7db99fa26f6e8c80a2a337e0de29a2f (6.18.53)
---
 include/linux/pid_namespace.h |   3 +
 include/linux/sched.h         |   3 +
 include/linux/uid_cputime.h   |  18 +++
 init/Kconfig                  |   8 ++
 kernel/Makefile               |   1 +
 kernel/exit.c                 |   2 +
 kernel/fork.c                 |   3 +
 kernel/pid_namespace.c        |   6 +
 kernel/uid_cputime.c          | 241 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 9 files changed, 285 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 include/linux/uid_cputime.h
 create mode 100644 kernel/uid_cputime.c

